(text "UART bus A: Mega Serial2 (TX2 D16 via 1k, RX2 D17) -> PDN/UART of DRV1-3 (addr 0,1,2).\nUART bus B: Mega Serial3 (TX3 D14 via 1k, RX3 D15) -> DRV4-5. Gives per-joint load (StallGuard), temperature and open-wire flags." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 375.92 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9572165e-64a5-4776-bda1-a2205f65c929))
(text "Gripper power: 24 V bus -> F1 -> U6 buck (set 6.0 V with a meter BEFORE connecting the servo) -> F2 -> 6 V (orange) -> C7, C8, servo." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 527.05 575.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid eabffd0c-74da-403e-897c-66f2111f6b96))
